abstract: >-
  Exact reversal spectra for reciprocal-smooth prime-factor laws and affine
  prime-pair products, with a formal equivalence between late ascents and
  recurring bounded prime gaps. Uniform coefficient comparisons yield RH
  criteria for moving ranks, positive areas and localized signed counts.
  Conditional fine last-ascent tracking retains its exact gap-coverage premise.
  AI-assisted research; independent review pending.
